      "instance_name": "juxtaposed_stereotype_scene",
      "label": "juxtaposed_stereotype_scene",
      "description": "A scene that juxtaposes a smiling Black teenager with a gorilla, using the text 'be careful who you call ugly in high school' to imply a harmful racial stereotype equating Black people with primates. The teenager is positioned in the upper half of the image, while the gorilla occupies the lower half, creating a visual contrast meant to provoke a reaction.",
