      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Hateful",
      "description": "The meme directly targets a protected characteristic (race) with derogatory and degrading imagery, reinforcing harmful stereotypes and potentially causing psychological harm to Black individuals or communities.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
